			"notes": "# Salonicraft is here!\nThis is the first Alpha release for Salonicraft. New additions to vanilla include:\n### Custom Items\n- Custard\n- Dough\n- Sweet Phyllo Dough\n- Cooked Sweet Phyllo\n- Raw Mpougatsa\n- Mpougatsa Thessalonikis\n- Mpougatsa with Cinnamon\n- Mpougatsa with Sugar Powder\n- Authentic Mpougatsa Thessalonikis\n- Golden Breakfast\n- Koulouri Dough\n- Strange Koulouri\n- Koulouri Thessalonikis\n- Tsoureki Dough\n- Tsoureki\n- Souvlaki\n- Cooked Souvlaki\n- Coffee Beans\n- Cinnamon\n- Sesame Seeds\n- Cinnamon Powder\n- Coffee Powder\n- Cocoa Powder\n- Sugar Powder\n- Milk Powder\n- Flour\n- Drinking Glass\n- Glass of Water\n- Glass of Milk\n- Frappes\n- Frappes with Milk\n- Kakao\n- One-Way OASTH Ticket\n- Two-Way OASTH Ticket\n\n### Custom Plants\n- Coffea\n- Sesame Crop\n- Cinnamon Tree\n\n### Custom Blocks\n- Powder Station\n- Beverage Brewer\n- Flour Sack\n- Cinnamon Log\n- Enriched Cinnamon Log\n- Cinnamon Wood\n- Stripped Cinnamon Log\n- Stripped Cinnamon Wood\n- Cinnamon Leaves\n- Cinnamon Planks\n- Cinnamon Slab\n- Cinnamon Stairs\n- Cinnamon Door\n- Cinnamon Trapdoor\n- Cinnamon Fence\n- Cinnamon Fence Gate\n- Cinnamon Button\n- Cinnamon Pressure Plate\n- Cinnamon Sign\n- Cinnamon Hanging Sign\n- Cinnamon Boat\n- Cinnamon Chest Boat\n\nThis is still a very early version, so you can expect many improvements, fixes and additions to come soon!\n\n![CinnamonBlocks](https://github.com/Selivanof/Salonicraft/assets/19632571/2d33cb5a-f25c-43eb-acb1-4bb53fc0b8cb)\n![InGame](https://github.com/Selivanof/Salonicraft/assets/19632571/46decb5c-c042-49c6-952b-ee28629aa959)\n![Items](https://github.com/Selivanof/Salonicraft/assets/19632571/e84fa253-e9ec-4d00-b5dc-89e8b96300b0)\n![Powders](https://github.com/Selivanof/Salonicraft/assets/19632571/3094c1b1-108b-4898-aa82-4dbace9c37d7)\n![Sesame](https://github.com/Selivanof/Salonicraft/assets/19632571/5aa93c22-4ea5-4716-bede-fb83883c4883)"
